Each block has its own custom property names: two blocks that interpolate the
same local name (`backgroundColor`) get different variables, also when
minified.

  $ refmt --parse re --print ml input.re > output.ml
  $ ../../standalone.exe --minify --impl output.ml -o output.ml
  $ styled-ppx.generate output.ml > styles.css
  $ cat styles.css
  /* This file is generated by styled-ppx, do not edit manually */
  @property --14b42r2-0{syntax:"*";inherits:false;}@property --zfnpzf-0{syntax:"*";inherits:false;}.css-14b42r2{background-color:var(--14b42r2-0);}.css-zfnpzf:hover{background-color:var(--zfnpzf-0);}
